    "detailed_description": "<h1>Development Process</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We made this game as 2 people. This has been a long time coming for us. If there are some deficiencies in the game, you can contact us.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in an Abandoned Mental Hospital, Daniel studies some notes to escape from here and tries to escape by solving the password. In this first-person game, you try to uncover the mysteries and escape from here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you examine the notes and find the passwords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find Notes and Keys, find coded or locked doors and find the necessary notes from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no Save System in this Game. The duration of the game is 30+ minutes.</p>",
